# Dogfood relay issues (`[Dogfood]`)

- **Runbook:** `docs/runbooks/restormel-dogfood-issue-implementation.md` — triage, security, minimal fix, tests, PR linkage, optional reply on source issue.
- **Policy:** `docs/github-dogfood-feedback.md`.
- **Security:** Do not copy secrets from relayed issue bodies into code, commits, or PRs. `docs/security-baseline.md`.
- If the user pastes an issue number or asks to implement a dogfood item, use `gh issue view` when available, then follow the runbook’s **Cursor agent prompt** pattern (issue #N, no secrets).
